
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <title>Document</title>
    </head>
    <body>
        <h1>Hi this is a url shortener project made from express.</h1>
        <h3>You can give any url in the form below and it will give a short url that u can use anywhere</h3>
        <label for="url">Enter a URL:</label>
        <br>
        <form action="/" method="POST">
            <input id="url" type="text" name="url" placeholder="https://example.com" required>
            <br>
            <button type="submit">Generate</button>
        </form>
    </body>
</html>
